# Zoraline, Cosmos Caller: "Whenever Zoraline enters or attacks, you may pay {W}{B} and 2 life. When you do, return target
# nonland permanent card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield with a finality counter on it."
# Turn 1 Bot1 Entombs an Ornithopter and casts Zoraline. As her enters trigger resolves Bot1 is asked the whole payment at
# once (CR 118.12), makes the {W} for it with Mox Pearl while asked (CR 605.3a), and pays {W}{B} and 2 life: 18 life. The
# reflexive trigger (CR 603.12) is put on the stack only then, its target chosen as it is - the Ornithopter - and returns
# it with a finality counter (CR 122.6). Turn 2 Bot2 Bolts the Ornithopter: with a finality counter it is exiled instead of
# going to the graveyard (CR 122.1h).

